{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117031","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117031/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117031/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117031/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117031","id":4017876810,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7Hq3Lb","number":117031,"title":"[Buildsystem] Pass \"-s\" flag directly to the linker when building with Emscripten without debug symbols","user":{"login":"NoctemCat","id":22471296,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDcxMjk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22471296?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat","html_url":"https://github.com/NoctemCat","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097455,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc0NTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:web","name":"platform:web","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":341,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T03:07:42Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-03-03T17:30:14Z","updated_at":"2026-09-30T17:08:54Z","closed_at":"2026-09-30T16:57:13Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117031","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117031","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117031.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117031.patch","merged_at":"2026-09-30T16:57:13Z"},"body":"~~As far as I found \"-s\" flag only applies to GCC, but if Clang worked fine before I decided to not touch it and only remove it from Emscripten. Emscripten can use \"-s\" flag with space to read build options, which is not something that we want here. I think release link flags went something like \"-s -Os\", so I guess if it meets another flag beginning with \"-\" it parses the next flag instead, but it shouldn't be passed to emscripten without build option in the first place.~~\r\n\r\n<img width=\"689\" height=\"144\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/557c3f33-72bb-40da-9cec-9b313d1d4ec7\" />\r\n\r\nI now actually found what it does https://github.com/emscripten-core/emscripten/blob/59f4772b815a13e48b4edcbdd5c74bf09104818c/tools/cmdline.py#L164:\r\n```python\r\ndef is_dash_s_for_emcc(args, i):\r\n  # -s OPT=VALUE or -s OPT or -sOPT are all interpreted as emscripten flags.\r\n  # -s by itself is a linker option (alias for --strip-all)\r\n```\r\nAnd replaced it with a safe direct linker flag, `emcc.py` parses them to the same link flag:\r\n```python\r\n    elif arg.startswith('-Wl,'):\r\n      for flag in arg.split(',')[1:]:\r\n        add_link_arg(flag)\r\n    elif arg == '-Xlinker':\r\n      add_link_arg(get_next_arg())\r\n    elif arg in {'-s', '-Bstatic', '-Bdynamic'} or arg.startswith(('-l', '-L', '--js-library=', '-z', '-u')):\r\n      add_link_arg(arg)\r\n```\r\nHere is how linker uses it (https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project/blob/f34ff31c6521b4fa62a24122743d1e76a6756087/lld/test/wasm/strip-all.s#L6)\r\n```\r\n## Test alias -s\r\n# RUN: wasm-ld -s -o %t2.wasm %t.start.o\r\n```\r\n\r\nIt having it or not having it, didn't change the final size when testing with `-Os` ","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117031/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117031/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}